WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:05.264
<v Today>Vantage opens on what needs you now, not on an empty dashboard.

2
00:00:05.265 --> 00:00:10.638
The figures report what the work produced. Record count is never shown as productivity.

3
00:00:10.684 --> 00:00:16.256
<v Records>Every outcome you logged, with the numbers attached.

4
00:00:16.256 --> 00:00:21.517
Private by default. Sharing with your unit is a decision you make per record.

5
00:00:21.517 --> 00:00:27.797
<v Reports>The same entries become a narrative, a bullet package, and a PDF.

6
00:00:27.797 --> 00:00:32.405
Every figure traces back to the record behind it. Nothing here is typed twice.
